<title>RUSSIA: Air France adds Paris-Moscow flight.</title>
<headline>Air France adds Paris-Moscow flight.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air France has begun a third regular daily flight between Moscow and Paris, a representative of the company's Moscow office said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Igor Bocharov said that the company would operate Airbus Industrie A-320s on the route.</p>
<p>He said that expected increased passenger traffic linked to celebrations marking the 850th anniversary of the founding of Moscow over the next few months was a major reason for the extra flight.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
